    "body": "Was already proposed in #4748\r\nBut it's been closed in favor of #4785, which I think is more aimed at short-circuiting video -> ImageData.\r\nI personally agree that having this option on the canvas's `getImageData` would still be useful too, so I'm not sure it should be closed because of #4785, but maybe the discussion should be done there anyway.",
