    "updated_at": "2021-04-27T06:02:34Z",
    "body": "Small quibble on the signature, presumably you don't need width and height parameters as the target already has those. And since you don't need a return value perhaps we should have a new method, e.g.,\r\n\r\n`getImageDataInto(x, y, destination)`\r\n\r\nIt seems that should fail though if destination points to a detached buffer so you cannot transfer to workers, but rather have to copy, right?",
