    "body": "> It seems that should fail though if destination points to a detached buffer so you cannot transfer to workers, but rather have to copy, right?\r\n\r\nThe ImageData can be constructed from a TypedArray, so you can still transfer the buffer back and forth and only create a new ImageData wrapper.",
